      "value": "100% needed! I run a horror show, which means I make a lot of our avatars for the actors. Making them public is a necessity, especially with quest users on our team, but I don't want strangers trying to use the avatars for their own reasons or during the shows to confuse people. Its well overdue cuz I know I'm not the only community x'D",
